kosha op-filter

  -- keep elements matching predicate, discard the rest.
  -- filter list (fn x -> bool)
  --
  -- this is a lattice operation: the result is a subset of the input,
  -- ordered by inclusion. filter IS selection (σ) applied to a list.
  -- pure: no state, no accumulation.

  "op-class-higher-order-kriya"
  "selection-abheda"
  "partial-order-sthita lattice-sthita"
  "subset-phala"

done
